      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783480689906,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Functional Requirements\n- View upcoming events\n- Book tickets to upcoming events\n- Search for upcoming events\n\n--------------- Below the line (Out of Scope) ----------\n\n- View their booked tickets\n- Admins flows(adding/editing/etc events)\n- Dynamic pricing for popular events",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Functional Requirements\n- View upcoming events\n- Book tickets to upcoming events\n- Search for upcoming events\n\n--------------- Below the line (Out of Scope) ----------\n\n- View their booked tickets\n- Admins flows(adding/editing/etc events)\n- Dynamic pricing for popular events",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "S70DQcQhJAwPE-qW61ty9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 121,
      "y": 692.5,
      "width": 937.0392456054688,
      "height": 300,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a3",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 483778160,
      "version": 410,
      "versionNonce": 307839088,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1783480839791,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Non-Functional Requirements\n- Availability for searching & viewing events, consistency for booking events (no double booking)\n- Handle popular events\n- Low latency search (< 500ms)\n- Read >> Writes\n\n------------------------ Below the line -------------------\n- GDPR\n- Backups\n- CI/CD\n- Fault tolerance\n- Purchase path security",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Non-Functional Requirements\n- Availability for searching & viewing events, consistency for booking events (no double booking)\n- Handle popular events\n- Low latency search (< 500ms)\n- Read >> Writes\n\n------------------------ Below the line -------------------\n- GDPR\n- Backups\n- CI/CD\n- Fault tolerance\n- Purchase path security",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
